              "coded_information": [
                "HPGE",
                "SCIN"
              ],
              "free_text": [
                " The gamma radiations were measured using",
                "two high-purity Ge (HPGe) clover detectors from the",
                "CLARION array. The neutron energies were measured",
                "with the newly commissioned TOF instrument, the",
                "Versatile Array of Neutron Detectors at Low Energy",
                " (VANDLE)."
              ]
            }
          ],
          "METHOD": [
            {
              "pointer": "",
              "coded_information": [
                "TOF",
                "COINC"
              ],
              "free_text": [
                " The 83,84Ga isotopes were produced at the",
                "Holifield Radioactive Ion Beam Facility (HRIBF) at",
                "Oak Ridge National Laboratory using the isotope",
                "separation online technique. The 200-keV ions were",
                "implanted into a tape in the Moving Tape Collector",
                " (MTC) in the middle of the beta-gamma-neutron",
                "counting setup. The neutron energies were measured",
                "with the TOF instrument VANDLE."
              ]
            }
          ],
